5. ⚠️ LIMITS
==============================================================================================================
  · TEACHER-FORCED. The emission's spread given the trunk's mu/theta (C-399).
  · A diagnostic, not a FAO-02 column. Selection use needs Simon's amendment first.
  · Conditioning on the ensemble MEAN is not conditioning on mu: the composition
    and the gate both enter the mean. It removes the mean's confound, not the gate's.
  · Equal-count bins of a heavily tied variable split ties across bins; a bin with
    no rank variance in sd or |error| is dropped and counted above, not imputed.
  · n=1 checkpoint, sb only, no sigma-hat on any number here.

